        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "c. 10.9 Acre Forestry Plantation For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to bring this block of Forestry to the Market. \r\n\r\nIt is mature and well established being planted for c. 25 years.\r\n\r\nTitle:                      Freehold - Folio SL4178F - Part of.\r\n\r\nArea:                     4.45 ha - 10.9 Acres.\r\n\r\nLocation:   \r\n\r\nSituated on the Coolaney/Collooney Road  (L2101).\r\n            \r\nIt is  c. 5 km from Collooney and 4 km from Coolaney\r\n \r\nIt adjoins the main road L2101\r\n\r\nThis plot of land is predominately forestry planted over 20 years.\r\n\r\nThe crop is Sitka Spruce and is well established.\r\n\r\nThere is a small section of land which has not been planted and is in pasture.\r\n\r\nThis is a  good investment opportunity with substantial yields in years to come.\r\n\r\nFurther details on application."
